These days I have started blaming myself for whatever wrong happens to me.
I feel guilty for my own pain caused by others. 
I have stopped asking for reasons and I started asking questions to myself.
Why do I feel this pain, why do they even have the privileges to hurt me?
Just because I love them? 
Just because I think that they love me?
Why do I say "I think" they love me?
Because I am not sure if they really do anymore? I am not even sure if they ever did.
Because, in my theories and experiences, I never want to hurt the person I love. 
I never want to be the reason for their pain. I always try to make them happy. 
Yes in past, I have tried to hurt people intentionally in case I am angry. 
I wanted to take revenge for something they did to me. 
Those were rare events, but not anymore. 
No matter how badly it is hurting, I don't want any revenge.
Revenge is a more intense feeling, even more intense than love. 
These days, when I get hurted by someone, I only feel pity on myself. 
Ohh poor me, I again trusted the same person.
Again gave them the power to hurt me.
And, every other time, the pain gets more intense.
But why?
Because, I have been overdoing things all my life.
I have overloved.
I have overcared.
I have overprotected them.
I have overtrusted them.
I have been over trying all this time to make them love me.
and why all these over doing I did?
Because I have been an over achiever all my life.
I beleive, I can achieve anything I want, if I try my 100%.
But No. Its not true.
Not everything can be achieved.
Not all battled can be won.
When your target is someone's love, you will end up hurting your own emotions. 
Because people really don't care about your emotions, they can just act that do.
But no one can keep on acting all their lives.
Someday the real face behind the character comes out and boom, you will not be even able to recognise them. 
Not because, you didn't know them but because you had let yourself fall for their roleplay. 
But, every movie ends and the movie of your life never have the happy endings. 
Happy endings are myth.
So, if you want to be not broken atleast at the end, then start acting "The Hero" in your movie.
You don't need someone else to save you from heartbreaks, its YOU who can save you.
Its YOU.

